            <div xml:id="d394">

                <pb facs="0471" n="461" sameAs="frus:frus1943China/pg461"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.5151/940: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Atcheson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chungking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-06-29T17:00:00+07:00">June 29, 1943—5
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 29—10:40 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1055. TF–136. From Adler to Secretary [of] Treasury only. Reference my TF–135 of
                    June 26. Dr. Kung informed me yesterday that he had instructed Dr. Soong to
                    approach the Treasury officially and ask for revision of the 1941 Agreement in
                    the spirit of Lend-Lease. [Adler.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Atcheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
